<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Admission Letter - <%= student.firstName %> <%= student.lastName %></title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }

  html, body {
    width: 210mm;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9.7pt;
    color: #1e293b;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }

  :root {
    --accent:   #0a6ebd;
    --accent-l: #dbeafe;
    --accent-m: #93c5e8;
    --rule:     #64748b;
    --label:    #475569;
    --body:     #1e293b;
    --grey-bg:  #f1f5f9;
    --red:      #b91c1c;
    --red-bg:   #fde8e8;
    --amber:    #92400e;
    --amber-bg: #fef3d6;
  }

  .page {
    width: 210mm;
    height: 297mm;
    padding: 12mm 16mm;
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 0 auto 6mm;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .hdr {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7mm;
    padding-bottom: 3.5mm; border-bottom: 2.5pt solid var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 4mm; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .hdr-img { width: 15mm; height: 15mm; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .hdr-center { flex: 1; text-align: center; }
  .hdr-center .dept    { font-size: 6.8pt; color: var(--body); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1mm; }
  .hdr-center .name    { font-size: 12.5pt;  font-weight: 700; color: var(--body); line-height: 1.2; }
  .hdr-center .contact { font-size: 6.8pt; color: var(--body); margin-top: 1mm; font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── TITLE BAND ── */
  .title-band {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
    border-radius: 3pt; padding: 2.8mm 5mm; margin-bottom: 4mm;
  }
  .title-band .doc-title,
  .title-band .receipt-no { font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }

  /* ── SALUTATION LINE ── */
  .salutation { font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
  .salutation .who { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .salutation .adm { color: var(--label); font-weight: 600; font-size: 8.7pt; }

  p.body-text { font-size: 9.7pt; line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 2.6mm; color: var(--body); text-align: justify; }
  p.body-text strong { color: var(--body); }

  /* ── ONE-LINE HIGHLIGHT STRIP ── */
  .strip {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1mm 4mm;
    background: var(--grey-bg); border-left: 3pt solid var(--accent);
    padding: 2.4mm 4mm; margin-bottom: 3.4mm; font-size: 8.8pt;
  }
  .strip span b { color: var(--accent); }
  .strip span.warn b { color: var(--red); }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 5.8pt; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    background: var(--label);
    display: inline-block; padding: 1mm 2.6mm;
    border-radius: 2pt; margin-bottom: 2mm; margin-top: 1mm;
  }

  /* ── COMPACT BANK LINE ── */
  .bank-line {
    font-size: 9.3pt; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 3mm;
    padding: 2.4mm 4mm; background: var(--grey-bg); border-radius: 2pt;
  }
  .bank-line b { color: var(--label); font-weight: 700; }

  .notice-bar {
    border-radius: 0 3pt 3pt 0; padding: 3mm 4.5mm; margin-bottom: 2.8mm;
    font-size: 8.8pt; line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .notice-bar.critical {
    background: var(--red-bg); border-left: 4pt solid var(--red);
    color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
  .notice-bar.amber {
    background: var(--amber-bg); border-left: 4pt solid var(--amber);
    color: var(--body);
  }

  .signoff { margin-top: 3mm; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.7; }
  .signoff .name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--body); }

  ul.req-list { margin-left: 5mm; margin-bottom: 2mm; }
  ul.req-list > li { font-size: 9.2pt; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--body); }
  ol.req-sublist { margin-left: 5mm; margin-top: 1mm; margin-bottom: 1.5mm; }
  ol.req-sublist li { font-size: 8.8pt; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--body); }

  .eng-note { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .4px; margin-left: 1.5mm; }

  @media print {
    html, body { width: 210mm; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; }
    .page { margin: 0; page-break-after: always; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══════════════ PAGE 1 — ADMISSION LETTER ══════════════ -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="hdr">
    <img src="https://www.riatirimbatvc.ac.ke/assets/logo-trans-CrKrf72f.png" class="hdr-img" alt="riatirimba tvc logo" />
    <div class="hdr-center">
      <div class="dept">Ministry of Education</div>
      <div class="name">Riatirimba Technical and Vocational College</div>
      <div class="contact">P.O. Box 25 – 40201 Gesusu &nbsp;·&nbsp; 0757 331 085 &nbsp;·&nbsp; info@riatirimbatvc.ac.ke</div>
    </div>
    <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSg-XiBlvGvjI6ZOmtBgWlXKaALHvvbpjzrMen3uga_LTz4-55e5LClsGk&s=10" class="hdr-img" alt="ministry of education logo" />
  </div>

  <div class="title-band">
    <span class="doc-title">Offer of Admission &amp; Joining Instructions</span>
    <span class="receipt-no">ADM #<%= student.admissionNumber %></span>
  </div>

  <div class="salutation">
    Dear <span class="who"><%= student.name %></span> &nbsp;<span class="adm">(Adm. No. <%= student.admissionNumber %>)</span>
  </div>

  <p class="body-text">
    Following your application for admission to Riatirimba Technical and Vocational College (RTVC), we
    are pleased to inform you that your application was successful. You have been offered a chance to
    pursue studies in <strong><%= student.course %></strong> under the
    <strong><%= student.department %></strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="strip">
    <span>Registration: <b>01/09/2026</b>, 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM</span>
    <span>Lectures Begin: <b>02/09/2026</b></span>
    <span class="warn">Report-by Deadline: <b>17/09/2026</b></span>
  </div>

  <p class="body-text">
    Those who will not have reported by the deadline above will be assumed to have no further interest
    in the training programme and will therefore have forfeited the chance.
  </p>

  <div class="section-heading">Payment of Fees</div>
  <p class="body-text">
    <strong>All fees required for the academic year (see Page 2 for details)</strong> must be deposited
    to the account below.
  </p>
  <div class="bank-line">
    <b>Account Name:</b> Riatirimba Technical and Vocational College &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    <b>Account No.:</b> 1283392763<br>
    <b>Bank:</b> Kenya Commercial Bank (KCB) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Branch:</b> Keroka
  </div>

  <div class="notice-bar critical">Admission fee once paid is non-refundable</div>

  <div class="notice-bar amber">
    <strong>NB:</strong> No cash will be accepted in the college. After making any payment, ensure that
    you obtain an official receipt bearing the college stamp.
  </div>

  <p class="body-text">
    The College does not allow any change of programmes midstream. Any request for change of programme
    must therefore be made within the first two weeks after opening. Please see the requirements and
    details in the appendices attached at the back of this letter.
  </p>

  <p class="body-text">
    For any inquiry kindly visit the college. We look forward to seeing you join us and trust that you
    will have a successful and memorable life here. Please make all efforts to meet the deadlines stated
    in this letter.
  </p>

  <div class="signoff">
    <em>Yours sincerely,</em><br>
    <span class="name">Kawala J.O</span><br>
    Principal / BOG Secretary
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════ PAGE 2 — JOINING INSTRUCTIONS & REQUIREMENTS ══════════════ -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="hdr">
    <img src="https://www.riatirimbatvc.ac.ke/assets/logo-trans-CrKrf72f.png" class="hdr-img" alt="riatirimba tvc logo" />
    <div class="hdr-center">
      <div class="dept">Ministry of Education</div>
      <div class="name">Riatirimba Technical and Vocational College</div>
      <div class="contact">P.O. Box 25 – 40201 Gesusu &nbsp;·&nbsp; 0757 331 085 &nbsp;·&nbsp; info@riatirimbatvc.ac.ke</div>
    </div>
    <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSg-XiBlvGvjI6ZOmtBgWlXKaALHvvbpjzrMen3uga_LTz4-55e5LClsGk&s=10" class="hdr-img" alt="ministry of education logo" />
  </div>

  <div class="title-band">
    <span class="doc-title">Joining Instructions &amp; Requirements</span>
    <span class="receipt-no">ADM #<%= student.admissionNumber %></span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Joining Instructions</div>
  <p class="body-text">
    <strong>Stationery:</strong> Students must bring ruled papers, A4 exercise books, files, pens, and a
    scientific calculator.
  </p>
  <p class="body-text">
    <strong>Health:</strong> A medical examination must be completed by a certified healthcare
    professional (Government Doctor or Registered Practitioner). The college provides only basic first
    aid; trainees are responsible for external medical expenses and are encouraged to utilize SHIF
    coverage.
  </p>

  <div class="section-heading">Requirements for Admission</div>
  <ul class="req-list">
    <li>
      Copies and originals of:
      <ol class="req-sublist">
        <li>Birth Certificate</li>
        <li>National ID</li>
        <li>Leaving Certificates (Primary &amp; Secondary)</li>
        <li>KCPE Result Slip</li>
        <li>KCSE Certificate / Result Slip</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
    <li>Two (2) coloured passport-size photographs</li>
    <li>One (1) ream of printing paper</li>
    <li>Four (4) spring files</li>

    <% if (student.isEngineering) { %>
    <li>
      Engineering Specific Requirements <span class="eng-note">applies to this student</span>
      <ol class="req-sublist">
        <li>Navy-blue dust coat or overall</li>
        <li>Safety boots</li>
        <li>Technical drawing set and T-square</li>
        <li>Scientific calculator (e.g. fx82MS, fx570ES PLUS)</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
    <% } %>
  </ul>
</div>

</body>
</html>
